#. module: ptplus_accounting_asset
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ptplus_accounting_asset
msgid ""
"===================\n"
"Portugal - Asset EE\n"
"===================\n"
"\n"
"This module implements legal and operational requirements for handling\n"
"assets in Portugal using Odoo Enterprise Edition.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Installation\n"
"============\n"
"\n"
"Add the module to an addons folder, restart Odoo, update the addons list and activate\n"
"it.\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"Available soon.\n"
"\n"
"Known issues / Roadmap\n"
"======================\n"
"\n"
"Available soon.\n"
"\n"
"Changelog\n"
"=========\n"
"\n"
"5.1.1 (2026-10-13)\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
"\n"
"**Bugfixes**\n"
"\n"
"- The Depreciation and Amortization Map (Modelo 32) now lists the assets of\n"
"  the company and of all its branches, and only those. Until now it listed\n"
"  the assets of the companies enabled in the company selector.\n"
"\n"
"5.1.0 (2023-11-16)\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
"\n"
"**Features**\n"
"\n"
"- Initial support for asset reporting: Modelo 32 (Pdf only)\n"
"\n"
"5.0.0 (2023-11-15)\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
"\n"
"**Features**\n"
"\n"
"- Initial changelog\n"
